{\rtf1\ansi\deff0 {\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Verdana;}}\f0\fs20 Siege of High Keep -- an asymmetric 1v3 castle siege. Three attackers with siege engines (catapult, trebuchet, battering ram) must breach a pre-built elevated stone castle and kill the defending King before the five-minute timer expires. Defenders pour boiling oil from the gatehouse and sortie to destroy the siege engines.}
